-- Source module: Solutions.KFZCall
/-!
# KFZ Call: the Prop 18 call inside the chirp procedure

**`Mcall j d18`**: mark the free leaf stack `X`, build the Prop 18 descriptor on `X` at run time
(`desc18P`, registers from `p, h, d, σ, K`), move it to the descriptor stack `d18` of the Prop 18
procedure over a mark (`xfer`), call `j`, and remove the descriptor again (`unxfer`).

**`M_runs`**: the call runs on the state `encK (bgS s G d18 l) (fC …)`: stack `0` holds exactly the
two record arrays, `d18` exactly the descriptor, every other managed stack is empty, and all other
contents (our tables, registers, the rest of stack `0`, the old contents of `d18`) are in the
unmanaged part `bgS`.
-/

